{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1310,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbc450e9102d5f65400462a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满满的勇气！源源不绝的活力！\r\n公主的干劲达到极致～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9fcd21c494b908da32170ec1f6781e82a8d48846771ae1c144abf31971a90a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdc49bbdf98f88d21e2964f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧来吧！\r\n看是要丢石头还是要练相扑，\r\n要做什么都没问题～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1719d52f6934d4f18504825e4e72cae04bd439d03492d6c2deac3a27896027d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb88e7342ed80f6c1e6e55c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪\r\n今天也会像个公主一样\r\n充满活力地锻炼喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b34ae5f9a416b0be7b25c2a832f43009b452d74cf90c23391c3e561a1f178b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337812f9f79799418d02a190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔嗯！！\r\n热身运动也高雅地做完咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a0eb24b9a752b7608742a5809e0320b2e99ba147b8e4bbca1718d401e3b06ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0e4cdc94c6ec72db428a7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练也是公主的嗜好……\r\n看我华丽地展现成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27013b543e1783596df83f4cb26009007bc64746c442693c68734875d17338fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6fc0f00dec2a1f42e0cda7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气势和高尚都很完美。\r\n我会照往常那样向前冲～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5e8b59f15ea2a61d461c72e06f33fbfdfdc73bb08c8dcf9f0da6351ea13868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90cb6028253a2dbea38b1977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有点提不起劲……\r\n如果有王子的笑容，\r\n我就能一口气恢复精神了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9a601edfe320dff5bb3fee4b689e92087ceb04d65d1391114067e9710b8171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f45f03828ad4afc596cc47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～觉得郁闷……\r\n这样根本不是\r\n平常的我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abd16212e48d9fd1052650d6daef7930d3a6fc2f14c7d17fc741b03fa94c339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf80c641464c97c59365b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要有气势、气势、气势……\r\n噗咻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1612f9e0cdb6dbe4ef4cd8cec2d9329e5fe37cbfde59b43129ef9f897bc7bec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f0c16412450a69486c02082",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……完全是个\r\n心情跌落谷底的公主啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "25bbb2d28e9aa918f12c54c234a061ee1034cdbfa89873d834b7ef188880afdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d89dff15fe5ac99d47584aa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要参加竞赛……\r\n虽然连续迎战强敌确实是\r\n不可缺少的剧情走向没错啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9c20a3c292f79566d0bb710f76f7a4b3e02a2d63165495afab97fbd479cc97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d478232b9c5d3970a49e561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……就算是公主战士\r\n也是有度假篇的喔。\r\n要不要偶尔做点其他的事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "527eac2f678944fe2b3e92ae67b750a2a3b207206e502957e859e291e1aa4d2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58abf5199bd9586d308f75d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！\r\n我要用捕捉王子的气势\r\n全力冲刺了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5f5801908e7a01cb08f0e119ea37ad0c7449c508a8bfe24eaec0fe009ae13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4dd20d14ad514de96bcd9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的对手\r\n都不会输！\r\n我就是最强的公主！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b69181afe85542a19fe6fb7ce0d09552f1f94de309def0ad6818f828083692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1abb4319a1f913c9f66ef9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在就连亚洲黑熊\r\n都不会是我的对手！喝啊！\r\n三两下就能轻易打倒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789e550c7be3cb16cbfcf6f8776bee4deccbfa554375f5a173b0175b1c3fd1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f968e0c63e575d016a9f36fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对决的时候到了～！！\r\n看我将所有劲敌全都打趴，\r\n全都……居然不行吗？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acb2c00e433577a788bffef52bd63a8be7696b9e3f5a8e328e3b4e9604028b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26956ce5af3e9f6d05c60f97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天似乎会有一场不错的对决！\r\n我会好好展现毅力的～！喝啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a49a17c8256a044319c555e50c845cf49c20ff19433adbcba41f3a19cf6f8359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3883356524b41434bb8bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出拳出脚都能精准到位！\r\n就让大家见识一下\r\n我的实力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3024972fc5ba2686fb5ced1ed594ccd6039de5b0e3cb5565cfc89c3fdddab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b129d5c39ff1bf074265c956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用你的那双眼睛\r\n将公主的光辉\r\n深刻烙印在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6539c628a42a526c87850c606b763c0692a85ae58e89800b9c40ccc1eec84513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e51db5fc2595abce75a0f8bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上公主的荣誉……\r\n我会赢得这场对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c438a03f35b8d0da29115038ea3048a400a1d5c5fe5d42d20f265c4fd2c878a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4797c6eda38c75e0a0e220c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会尽全力展现\r\n至今为止锻炼的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3449d7d667a9369035e8b1ce63facc0bb50bb3d599c90492db8062701b78f29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f473376628a75695dd48fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……得要好好\r\n拿出气势才行……吸气──\r\n意志力、意志力、超强意志力～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e16c1a2686678b4757bd0070d20ff576d6e788e03904650f15d2444e10bfba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbc24d418448658fd2f4b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够扭转逆境才是\r\n一流的公主……\r\n圣王也这么说过的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f97e2eb6f8a2463382b179c68ca70ecac6d8867e832e9c74e7afb614c0829b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d422b40fcb4d652357c087f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多么艰辛的战斗，\r\n公主战士都一路赢了过来。\r\n既然如此……我也不能输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe07716d4d00cb0a907eb8ff8c00a8e9d2a82c38fb1b6d1fe73b0921df82e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895207e83910e0c7192946f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……不安算什么！\r\n我可是公主，\r\n才不会输给那种东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09d74ad52db85e37946b871f869ad6c704cb6979342b12e0b21016c674952da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58cd60d344de5d2a4537f30a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是公主被赋予的试炼……\r\n一定要想办法跨越才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac88015536fb1b6bf195ed4dafdd9a1430c39f58e339395a44f7a1334c41c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064d0b12715920347c307c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有股危机的预感……！\r\n不过既然身为公主，\r\n就不能逃离对决……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e140d57cee1354bcd254c2d2a2bc3984bf6b52ab8ffa6dd7051847ce90b23db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15eea213b842aa3bb17e8f9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a20445efc92ced5a853877bbc3dc19f02810ae70cb734d737dd622a716d0abe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f366c4d49367922a92b5d243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高雅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f5687ee743801074a92dc1d4dceab8cc8e153a1c3ce1c98fce9adb9cae2d600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecebb32227e5771295e99736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "英勇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a494c282a6a8dd1c9b94175893b83c54341362079eceb05de275e8327846927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2add1e4a38b44fd315844edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ff4925698843c3792c7f0bc377e245a84f32db565113d4ccaa189fe812f9dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c44ca1bace5714a778676b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "389a7927edeb4462831b02a224a99f46d1c494fb3995b8bce21bce95ca602692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6be6e9e62d3c18380a9d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜呜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "292005db2390b5b66da66c9a3d47d17ff4fdb60b355999f7dcdfc9fda6f552a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69138a96cc68d481700ae7cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16649f8449bfeabe47d116b4a29dbe00db7880c3a9aa606c699a791f6a399f2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c2369fbbdccd294f7e161d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是海耶～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e6e099108feacaf992f9bf73149707c58a5e41ce1e512d4cc5169a5c5c11af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5139f091728e7700d4a187cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪着公主！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0781a9a6668094a1d2bad84d694cfdbc7e00152402241369f35ceacedfd6d00c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4731afa1e7bff4ecebc573b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26701c769cfefbbbea86ff99e56377c406a729226c931062ee990cfcc18a12e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f2aaf2948daa57c4bc57c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我要打起精神上咯──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9356a9cc19dcb1b868af46a2af167bcd7633495d3b77359190232927e1b6cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e46f82c91e1cb1035c6b980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不会输的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe04caae268b3cf481f758bd1f7e06ef363e3b6bea14f1078530934b3b35d9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bba518b6d531d0b6e9558ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主队上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b13d35aed34caf956cec9b3f17022e41874060691c9d9b1a064cd52d867c67e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a9dc6ccc2e8d3617af5ab8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26701c769cfefbbbea86ff99e56377c406a729226c931062ee990cfcc18a12e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b936bb4ceb13343cb8c4c5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出拳出脚都能精准到位！\r\n就让大家见识一下\r\n我的实力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3024972fc5ba2686fb5ced1ed594ccd6039de5b0e3cb5565cfc89c3fdddab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941dd612812bee9b8087efb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在就连亚洲黑熊\r\n都不会是我的对手！喝啊！\r\n三两下就能轻易打倒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789e550c7be3cb16cbfcf6f8776bee4deccbfa554375f5a173b0175b1c3fd1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc1f1ed2ae8b1210a41c44f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26701c769cfefbbbea86ff99e56377c406a729226c931062ee990cfcc18a12e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3adb6c854e3f7e2874cbfa96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華麗に！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1193af77321b313d7a2601f1f12b43d78f3aef22aa5726e78bb5f8891ac55c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde5c047c35cfd1bc8b5916b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不只这样呢～！！\r\n敬请期待下回！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65cae4c56c3f6a07af931be1fe350be32f2cae8aa1749067ecde38bf93edaef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f69fd1ce6b9ce8bf41fa90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算是差强人意的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5423da4a3da85c2bea9839c46b327802dcb19dd80e8ae6942c647eace9e1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1191c316cc4bee1c0679474d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的成果无法令人满意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d059493e070db58e55b622398bbe5358f2c92e8ffcdbb05faa2f3a3cbf90dd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40646065a279ae8e699abb96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次可不会这样了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05ff5215b4988ea10d8e5e836d6c027a0aceaf81443ed5f80c62a306a09319e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006d6f22cacd5d775beb766f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主大获全胜！\r\n这是理所当然的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a6356ad5b4afbffeb7928e5b2cb25edbbf4a70fec7e7daef1d6e542e2af717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa0211f396c194cc5814bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有看到公主的杰出表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "275c2a990753219ce74f8e44e3118f974295b4c991837491d25a22e8bf1a002e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d329f8b83475fc838aca7cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごらんあれ！これが華麗な姫の舞…ですわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f3a16fccb11372d0a0007ce1a6b31d9c41e374d4c3e004ccfdad8055f1aa4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90164776367774191be7c0a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫の活躍、ごらんいただけまして？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b58516ab62b548a8da512710eaa55d89fc9b6d985bafe83918a8e800adcd9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95e549a6ebb15b49d962d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主上场☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6447f551943518a89cb84d25a9d79f8cfc3b5a6a1eb654f6e514374fff07960d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52bafe5a7207bb91ec516667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀☆攻击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afb696e401950d2a553fe61531f424acf85c54d8a39892bd8f344e77f6fc88ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1848fa8aa9c03a16c5a54c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんと一緒のお舞台…！\r\n気合い入れて臨みますわよっ！\r\nまずは…目指せ握力400㎏！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60b5232160b7a4a7cf55c9f5478379624505a0f43e24c22c9edc1799e28536c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c597f793ddcdea4cb741168b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……哼……！很好！\r\n我现在充满干劲，\r\n就连感谢祭也能一口气跑完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ab5b235381961318db3966949781c2563ca467ff1e9295f0ddf02f81989c048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bd1e5a9b1e27083ba93f13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就让大家见识一下，\r\n身为公主的意志力吧！意志力、\r\n意志力、超强意志力～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2997ca01d8f2928b72658b52ed67a2899c9adc7f94f7d4ce18f5aca0fb2135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a544c1a72a9a2cfcb7a46886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "でぇええりゃああああーー！！\r\n血ヘド吐いてでも演じ切りますわ！\r\nこの想い！この気合い！この拳で！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9bb84cfa6c615d0915b57fb53f459eb66c161f418404cd255450903e004fbe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50c6731cb7b40275e06e693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他でもないこの私に、キングさんは\r\n想いを託してくださった。\r\n…応えられましたかしら、ちゃんと",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7ef4daeccee0893a0508911984ecad921e0536c7fcf3d16ae7dd509e975418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45304a8d1215c3ce54dd4301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽高雅最强最快！川上公主！\r\n全都让开！公主要通过咯！！\r\nVictory！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1eab6cb224aae514eb1882f3b0ddec7ceb93d4ac872c4a21b5aea2d90314aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1247fb98cc710dd8a4c4e7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务是在这里确认！\r\n既然目标是成为一流的公主……\r\n就只能拼命往前冲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb7ef96df891211055d5c2f50bfa87ba51cc214dc349ffcd0a785f7c8c8064d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c81d6d817d25e5dcfd8cfab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别忘了领取报酬！\r\n把报酬和重要回忆一起带回去后，\r\n活动才算是正式结束喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b966a86eeb54b5163759c4c936678eea3b48acc8c6a8649d6393331b6c39852d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ffc914a5c4241b774e9769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝶のように舞い、姫のごとく砕く！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e5576cd2acf308466a96c2acc1ac155243928fdd75b785bcc654fb691f4638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5015e435b51f8ef6d014848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "掛けまくも畏き三柱に…\r\n姫たる舞をご奉納ですわっ、どっせええ～い！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e31e15fa7ad261ca5e5531fe951e6e1dff573c28f33353ab610e2c45ca82645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3724db2e9ccf514abe9cfde4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6b0c83feadc082eddfdc34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3089ea8e79450048eb9505f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc8b13604d3e0630735e014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13e84f299f5f5056599a3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414ae427217adea7b80c6d9166bb6ebc72df2f6b1b370616339ff4156cfba39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e5e3373890dfca045f90da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414ae427217adea7b80c6d9166bb6ebc72df2f6b1b370616339ff4156cfba39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2f0b780a14dfa49ab75b85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9abc5c9ff61bd39d9ae50cd1cac2b8d52195360c80f49e2d6a2e6208d1d8836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
